      "notes": "MIDI controller table (page 27) read by tools/profiles/behringer/read-behringer-cc.mjs from QSG_BE_0722-ABR_JT-4000-MICRO_WW.pdf (sha256 0c49849602a502e08428395d529b568e736aa42de7bb60b4e2ae936cba98e976), https://cdn-media.empowertribe.com/7bad56e3d4f94b5ca2d36494034e1ea9/QSG_BE_0722-ABR_JT-4000-MICRO_WW.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
